<title>SINGAPORE: Wah Shing sees satisfactory growth in '97.</title>
<headline>Wah Shing sees satisfactory growth in '97.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wah Shing International Holdings Ltd said on Friday it expects satisfactory growth in 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it expected manufacturing capacity to see continued growth.</p>
<p>The group plans to improve labor efficiency through various methods like automation and enhanced materials management.</p>
<p>Wah Shing's net profit for 1996 rose 19 percent to HongKong $102.77 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
